author: pi-agent
estimated_minutes: 60
acceptance_criteria: "Exact dependency-refresh reproduction at SDK 2026.8.17 - npm ci installs @unbrained/pm-cli 2026.8.14 from lockfile, npm update --save resolves to 2026.8.17, and the pre-fix TS2322 failure at test/vcs-commands.test.ts:188 and :189 reproduces before the fix and clears after it.; Correct GetItemProjection fixture contract - both fabricated GetResult literals in test/vcs-commands.test.ts carry an item id so they satisfy the SDK GetItemProjection contract that gained a required id member in @unbrained/pm-cli 2026.8.17.; No casts, pins, or production changes - the fix touches only the test fixture, introduces no any/unknown casts, leaves the @unbrained/pm-cli devDependency range at ^2026.8.14 and the lockfile at 2026.8.14, and edits no production source.; Mutation and revert proof - reverting the fixture back to an item with an empty object reproduces TS2322 at test/vcs-commands.test.ts:188 and :189 under 2026.8.17, and restoring the id makes npm run build:test pass, so a test that passes both implementations is ruled out.; Full release:check exits 0 at 2026.8.17 across typecheck, build, build:test, lint, duplicates, docstring, coverage, accept:native-toon, accept:stat-cache, accept:self-host, audit:prod, audit:identities, pack:dry-run, and changelog:check.; Coverage gate c8 --all --100 reports All files 100 / 100 / 100 / 100 with no uncovered lines, branches, functions, or statements.; Real tarball SDK-harness proof - the resolved @unbrained/pm-cli@2026.8.17 package from the npm registry supplies dist/sdk/query/get.d.ts declaring the required id member that 2026.8.14 omits, confirming a real SDK tightening rather than a local type artifact.; Self-host bundle convergence - npm run self-host:write regenerates selfhost.bundle so the accept:self-host gate passes against the committed source tree and no committed source-bundle drift remains.; Unchanged disabled release workflow - .github/workflows/release.yml is neither modified nor enabled and pm-vcs publication stays approval-gated, with the dependency-refresh workflow owning the version bump.; No publication - no npm publish, git tag, GitHub release, or merge is performed, and the result is a local amended commit only."
reporter: pi-agent
severity: high
environment: dev dependency @unbrained/pm-cli ^2026.8.14; lockfile pins 2026.8.14; npm update --save resolves to 2026.8.17
repro_steps: "1) npm ci (installs 2026.8.14 from lockfile); 2) npm update --save (resolves @unbrained/pm-cli to 2026.8.17); 3) npm run build:test -> TS2322 at test/vcs-commands.test.ts:188 and :189; 4) npm run release:check fails at the build:test step."
resolution: "Fixed by correcting the test fixture only: the linkedFiles projection-normalization test in test/vcs-commands.test.ts now fabricates GetResult literals with an item id so they satisfy the SDK GetItemProjection contract that gained a required id member in @unbrained/pm-cli 2026.8.17. No dependency pin, cast, or production change. Verified against the drifted SDK resolved by npm update --save to 2026.8.17: build:test passes, full release:check exits 0, c8 --all --100 reports All files 100/100/100/100, and reverting the fixture reproduces TS2322 at :188 and :189. The lockfile stays at 2026.8.14 and the dependency-refresh workflow owned by pm-vcs-17li owns the version bump; .github/workflows/release.yml is unchanged and publication stays approval-gated."
expected_result: "The weekly Dependency Refresh workflow runs npm update --save (resolving @unbrained/pm-cli to the latest ^2026.8.x, currently 2026.8.17), then npm run release:check, and opens a refresh PR when changed."
actual_result: "release:check fails at npm run build:test with: test/vcs-commands.test.ts(188,34): error TS2322: Type '{}' is not assignable to type 'GetItemProjection'. Property 'id' is missing in type '{}' but required in type '{ id: string; ... }'. Same error repeats at line 189."
